   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Whenever a schema changes, TWO populations exist at the same time: old data still sits in the log, and old code is still running. So every change\nraises two separate questions.",
   "originalText": "Whenever a schema changes, TWO populations exist at the same time: old data still sits in the log, and old code is still running. So every change\nraises two separate questions.",
