   "seed": 131745057,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2068586656,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1764115200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "NOT protected: an UPGRADED consumer reading\nOLD data still in the log. That is the BACKWARD\nquestion and nobody checked it. So FORWARD\nalone is rare on replayable topics.\n\nTypical use: a fast producer team, lagging\nconsumers (analytics, partners) that read only\n'now'.",
   "originalText": "NOT protected: an UPGRADED consumer reading\nOLD data still in the log. That is the BACKWARD\nquestion and nobody checked it. So FORWARD\nalone is rare on replayable topics.\n\nTypical use: a fast producer team, lagging\nconsumers (analytics, partners) that read only\n'now'.",
   "fontSize": 27,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
