   "text": "The mode tells you which rollout order is safe. Follow the data: at every step ask 'who writes what, and can every running reader decode it?'",
   "originalText": "The mode tells you which rollout order is safe. Follow the data: at every step ask 'who writes what, and can every running reader decode it?'",
