   "updated": 1764115200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BACKWARD registers v3 (only v3 vs v2 is checked). Later a consumer reading from earliest hits a v1 message and throws.\nBACKWARD_TRANSITIVE checks v3 against v1 AND v2, and REFUSES v3.",
   "originalText": "BACKWARD registers v3 (only v3 vs v2 is checked). Later a consumer reading from earliest hits a v1 message and throws.\nBACKWARD_TRANSITIVE checks v3 against v1 AND v2, and REFUSES v3.",
