   "text": "Avro identifies a field by NAME. So a rename is really: DELETE the old name + ADD the new name. What happens next depends on the defaults.",
   "originalText": "Avro identifies a field by NAME. So a rename is really: DELETE the old name + ADD the new name. What happens next depends on the defaults.",
