   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "They are READER-side: they help only if the\nconsumer decodes with a reader schema carrying the\nalias, in a library that honours aliases. Verify your\nchecker applies them (C10).",
   "originalText": "They are READER-side: they help only if the\nconsumer decodes with a reader schema carrying the\nalias, in a library that honours aliases. Verify your\nchecker applies them (C10).",
