   "text": "Step 6 is only legal if amount_cents has a DEFAULT. Otherwise it is a\nforbidden 'remove field with no default'. So give every field a default from day\none, even ones that 'always exist': the future needs an exit.",
   "originalText": "Step 6 is only legal if amount_cents has a DEFAULT. Otherwise it is a\nforbidden 'remove field with no default'. So give every field a default from day\none, even ones that 'always exist': the future needs an exit.",
