   "text": "How: rewrite old data into the new\nshape (Kafka Streams or a batch job\ninto a new topic), or upcast in the\nconsumer.\n\nTrade-off: compute and complexity,\nbut the registry stays strict.",
   "originalText": "How: rewrite old data into the new\nshape (Kafka Streams or a batch job\ninto a new topic), or upcast in the\nconsumer.\n\nTrade-off: compute and complexity,\nbut the registry stays strict.",
