   "text": "v3 also changes S3-F8's data flow (header vs value). That is a DESIGN decision the checker cannot see: consumers read the value when present, else the\nheader, until the header is retired.",
   "originalText": "v3 also changes S3-F8's data flow (header vs value). That is a DESIGN decision the checker cannot see: consumers read the value when present, else the\nheader, until the header is retired.",
