   "updated": 1764115200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "C10 'schema compatibility': attempt each change under BACKWARD and FULL; run an old consumer on new data and a new consumer on old data.\nThese are PREDICTIONS: fill the last column when you run it, and where reality differs, trust the experiment and find out why.",
   "originalText": "C10 'schema compatibility': attempt each change under BACKWARD and FULL; run an old consumer on new data and a new consumer on old data.\nThese are PREDICTIONS: fill the last column when you run it, and where reality differs, trust the experiment and find out why.",
