   "text": "One line: BACKWARD = new code reads old data (consumers first). FORWARD = old code reads new data (producers first). FULL\n= both (any order). TRANSITIVE = against all history, not just the previous version.",
   "originalText": "One line: BACKWARD = new code reads old data (consumers first). FORWARD = old code reads new data (producers first). FULL\n= both (any order). TRANSITIVE = against all history, not just the previous version.",
